		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Spirit of those who froze to death. Frigid cloud of obscuring fog with two 4- foot-long chicken feet emerging from mist.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tendril +4 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cold Mist</strong>. Surrounded by near-sized cold mist centered on the spirit. All mortals within, CHA 15+ on turn or 1d4 DEX damage, frozen solid at 0 DEX. Ranged attacks have DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
